139
01:05:28.138 --> 01:05:32.138
It is hard work. It is hard work and I love them.

140
01:05:32.138 --> 01:05:34.138
Praise God.

141
01:05:37.138 --> 01:05:42.138
Let us close our eyes. Dear Father in heaven, we want to get to know you better.

142
01:05:42.138 --> 01:05:49.138
That is the main prayer. We want to get to know you better.

143
01:05:49.138 --> 01:05:55.138
For as we get to know you better, we have a greater perspective of you.

144
01:05:55.138 --> 01:05:59.138
Of your almightiness and of your greatness. Also of your plan.

145
01:05:59.138 --> 01:06:05.138
And as we look at your plan and at your almightiness, our worship, our worship becomes greater.

146
01:06:05.138 --> 01:06:09.138
And that is what we want. We want Jesus to become greater in our hearts.

147
01:06:09.138 --> 01:06:12.138
That we can worship him better.

148
01:06:12.138 --> 01:06:15.138
Shape us Jesus through these words.

149
01:06:15.138 --> 01:06:19.138
So that we may resemble you more and know more of you, in Jesus' name.

150
01:06:19.138 --> 01:06:21.138
And we all say to him.

151
01:06:21.138 --> 01:06:28.138
Please take a seat in the presence of the Almighty King.

152
01:06:28.138 --> 01:06:35.138
