01:52:57.138 --> 01:53:00.138
And that it is our fault.

1050
01:53:00.138 --> 01:53:04.138
And First and Second Chronicles says, this is the story.

1051
01:53:04.138 --> 01:53:06.138
Yes, we made mistakes.

1052
01:53:06.138 --> 01:53:08.138
But we will not talk about that now.

1053
01:53:08.138 --> 01:53:10.138
Because now we need to rebuild.

1054
01:53:10.138 --> 01:53:13.138
For we have a God who is always faithful.

1055
01:53:13.138 --> 01:53:15.138
Shall we stand, people?

1056
01:53:22.138 --> 01:53:24.138
A lot here.

1057
01:53:24.138 --> 01:53:26.138
So we will do that next time.

1058
01:53:26.138 --> 01:53:29.138
Because everyone is going to eat, boy.

1059
01:53:29.138 --> 01:53:32.138
It is not normal what everyone is going to eat.

1060
01:53:32.138 --> 01:53:34.138
Shall we close our eyes?

1061
01:53:35.138 --> 01:53:43.138
Shall we close our eyes and think of that one person who can truly restore everything?

1062
01:53:44.138 --> 01:53:45.138
Close your eyes.

1063
01:53:45.138 --> 01:53:51.138
And think of that one person who can truly restore everything.

1064
01:53:52.138 --> 01:53:54.138
Not King Cyrus.

1065
01:53:55.138 --> 01:53:58.138
Not a president of this time.

1066
01:53:58.138 --> 01:54:01.138
Not a prime minister of this time.

1067
01:54:01.138 --> 01:54:04.138
No one can bring complete restoration.

1068
01:54:04.138 --> 01:54:10.138
For all the mistakes of all people of all times.

1069
01:54:10.138 --> 01:54:12.138
No one can do that.

1070
01:54:12.138 --> 01:54:19.138
No one is worthy to offer redemption to all of creation.

1071
01:54:19.138 --> 01:54:22.138
Except for one person.

1072
01:54:22.138 --> 01:54:25.138
And his name is Jesus.

1073
01:54:25.138 --> 01:54:27.138
His name is Jesus.

1074
01:54:29.138 --> 01:54:35.138
Lord Jesus, I want to ask you at the end of this service, at the end of these ten days.

1075
01:54:35.138 --> 01:54:38.138
Lord, I want to ask you to shape our hearts.

1076
01:54:38.138 --> 01:54:39.138
Also in the time to come.

1077
01:54:39.138 --> 01:54:41.138
Give us enlightenment.

1078
01:54:41.138 --> 01:54:43.138
Give us insight into your Word.

1079
01:54:43.138 --> 01:54:46.138
Shape us here according to the words of your Scripture.

1080
01:54:46.138 --> 01:54:51.138
And what has become hardened clay, what has become dried clay.

1081
01:54:51.138 --> 01:54:55.138
Make it wet by your Holy Spirit and by the water of baptism.

1082
01:54:55.138 --> 01:54:58.138
Make it wet, so that we can become pliable again.

1083
01:54:58.138 --> 01:55:00.138
And you can mold our hearts.

1084
01:55:00.138 --> 01:55:04.138
Lord, so that we can be shaped according to the narrative of the Bible.

1085
01:55:04.138 --> 01:55:07.138
And not according to the opinions of our own lives.

1086
01:55:07.138 --> 01:55:09.138
Lord, shape us, for that is repentance.

1087
01:55:09.138 --> 01:55:12.138
Lord, we want to give ourselves to you.

1088
01:55:12.138 --> 01:55:14.138
And this is the prayer of the past ten days.

1089
01:55:14.138 --> 01:55:16.138
We want to give ourselves to you, Lord.

1090
01:55:16.138 --> 01:55:19.138
We want to be shaped by your King Jesus.

1091
01:55:19.138 --> 01:55:21.138
You are worth everything to us.

1092
01:55:21.138 --> 01:55:27.138
And I bless us all that we will love Jesus more and more.

1093
01:55:27.138 --> 01:55:28.138
Keep your eyes closed.

1094
01:55:28.138 --> 01:55:32.138
I want to say the following words at the end of this service.

1095
01:55:32.138 --> 01:55:35.138
May the Lord bless you and protect you.

1096
01:55:35.138 --> 01:55:41.138
May the Lord make his face shine upon you and be gracious to you.

1097
01:55:41.138 --> 01:55:45.138
May the Lord turn his face toward you and give you peace.

1098
01:55:45.138 --> 01:55:47.138
In the mighty name of Jesus.

1099
01:55:47.138 --> 01:55:50.138
Amen, amen, and amen.

1100
01:55:52.138 --> 01:55:54.138
Have a nice day everyone.

1101
01:55:54.138 --> 01:55:57.138
Remember to eat after you have fasted for a long time.

1102
01:55:57.138 --> 01:56:01.138
Don't eat too quickly, too fatty, and too heavy, because then you will get sick from it.

1103
01:56:01.138 --> 01:56:04.138
Tomorrow, I don't think there is a prayer, is there, Nes?

1104
01:56:04.138 --> 01:56:06.138
No prayer tomorrow, right?

1105
01:56:06.138 --> 01:56:08.138
Tomorrow we will take a day off.

1106
01:56:08.138 --> 01:56:11.138
So we will see you all again on Sunday.

1107
01:56:12.138 --> 01:56:15.138
Thursday yes, Thursday is intercession night.

1108
01:56:15.138 --> 01:56:17.138
God bless you all.

1109
01:56:17.138 --> 01:56:19.138
Hallelujah, praise the Lord.
